// 0x001C6450 sub_1C6450 [K_FldEvent_CanSeePos] -- 396 bytes; frame 0x90: ra sp+0x40, s2 sp+0x30 (sq), s1 sp+0x20 (sq), s0 sp+0x10 (sq), f20 sp+0x0
// (matrix $a0, point $a1, field of view $f12, range $f13) -> $v0 1 when the point is inside the field of view
// (sub_1C6200, $f12 passed through), nearer than the range, and the collision ray sub_1ACC30 is clear both ways
// between the matrix position and the point, each raised by 100 (the segment {from, to} at sp+0x50, the hit out at
// sp+0x70; the ray returns 1 when blocked). Callers: the Tartarus / NPC think code (sight checks).
